#! console --size 120x34 --config '{"console":{"titleIntro":true,"titleWeights":{"kali":1}}}'
# A console start with the Kali fold pinned: the animation covers the whole screen, the rail and
# the hint row included; the name holds briefly, then the screen comes back around it, and it is over at 3 s.
# The clock is frozen, so each snap is the frame at that second. A key would end it at once.
# The cover hides the hint row, so there is no text to wait for: a pause lets the first frame draw.
wait 400
tick 500
snap opening
tick 1000
snap name-rising
tick 600
snap held
tick 400
snap landing
tick 400
snap landed
tick 200
snap over
quit
